msgstr "Choose the entity structure to set up — the preview on the right updates live."

msgid "Classification de sensibilité (norme ISO 27001, à affiner selon vos besoins)."
msgstr "Sensitivity classification (ISO 27001 standard, to be refined to your needs)."

