msgstr "No filtering by product type is possible (native GLPI limitation, verified) — but a manufacturer reported by inventory under a slightly different name (\"Hewlett-Packard\" instead of \"HP\") will automatically be attached to the same manufacturer record instead of creating a new duplicate one."

